WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.300
I'm Jacques Necker, the Minister of Finance.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.070
I know you very well.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.950
You were dismissed from your post as
Minister of Finance, but later re-appointed.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.380
We're aware of the situation
surrounding your dismissal.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:19.980
Despite being a palace politician,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.080
you published the deficit
spending of the royal account.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.330
I only did what was right as the one
in charge of the country's finances.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:33.390
And now you're advocating to tax, not only us,
commoners, but the clergy and nobility, as well.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.390
What's more, at an extremely high tax rate.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.510
Perhaps I might get dismissed again.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:42.230
No, we'll protect you this time.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:46.170
Despite being in the palace, you pay no
attention to the privileges of the court,

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:50.010
and are the only one who has a sense of
thoughtful justice and equality.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.990
You think too highly of me.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.950
The people have high expectations of you.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.880
As long as you're in the palace,

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.290
they hope that the King will eventually
approve the National Assembly.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.490
You are telling me to persuade the King?

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.790
Is that why you have requested
this secret meeting?

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.000
In order to avoid bloodshed
and reform the government,

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.300
we have no other option but to ask for your help!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.600
A revolt can be avoided, as long as
the National Assembly is approved!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.440
I'll see what I can do.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:29.480
If that'll save our ailing country even a little...

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.920
Approve the National Assembly!

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:36.910
The King must approve us, the true
representatives of France immediately!

